WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:06.480
You emit a good Tera, stray Mototsumitama.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.270
I'll squeeze every bit from you.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.490
We can do it the easy way or the hard way.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:14.950
So be a nice girl and...

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.370
You bitch!

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.850
Take a good look at your prey when you're hunting.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.270
Want to perform a contract?

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.350
You want to be my contractee?

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.730
There's someone I want to defeat.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.070
You want vengeance?

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:57.610
Who is it?

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.370
Shishigami Reishin.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:05.620
What's in it for me?

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:23.890
What would you say of me, paying a Mototsumitama for a contract to avenge you?

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.060
Steiner!

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.490
Say...

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:43.580
You're serious about defeating Reishin, right?

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.750
Getting cold feet?

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.130
After performing the contract and exchanging hearts?

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.840
I couldn't run after all this, could I?

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:58.590
The payment would be a good motivation.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.100
If we die...

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.520
It's meaningless.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:10.810
"Disaster"

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.060
My brother will definitely be where the Reiseki is.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:12.610
Kuro!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:18.450
If my brother is trying to attain the power of the Masagami, then I'll definitely stop him.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.620
Hey, Kuro! Are you deaf?

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:25.040
I told you to wait.

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:26.620
Look at Yakumo.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.620
I am fine.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.130
Yakumo, I'm sorry.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.670
I really am fine. Let's move forward.

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:38.920
Enough of that. You can barely walk.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:43.390
But we must catch up to Reishin-sama as soon as possible.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:47.890
Nothing good will come out of dragging dead weight.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.400
Says you, the person who won't do more than just watch.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.860
If you're going to criticize me for just watching, then shouldn't you do the same to this thing?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.240
Punipuni doesn't count.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:02.910
Besides, why do I have to help you?

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.410
Geez. Just shut up.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.750
Whether I talk or not is my business.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.910
Smartass.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:12.960
Anyway, let's take a break.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:16.880
If we overdo it and exhaust ourselves, it will affect our fighting.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.170
What?

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.260
What was that?

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.680
I feel the presence of a Mototsumitama.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.770
Another one seeking the power of Masagami, like that Aragi before?

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.480
Most likely.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.650
Let's go around. We should avoid unnecessary fights.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.440
This is the only path we can take.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:44.410
You guys stay here. I'll see how things are.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.620
Hey! Kuro!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.490
Princess!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.670
Another Mototsumitama's here, Kohaku.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:04:00.340
What a bunch of fools. We're the ones who'll get the Masagami's power.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.800
Right, Tenma?

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.350
What is it?

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.850
Someone's here.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.150
What?

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:24.570
Riona-san, we should go see how things are.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.780
It's fine. Just get some rest!

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.450
But...

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.200
What's that?

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.910
This?

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.710
It's a Joyjoy.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.380
It looks tasty. How many do you have?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.470
Here. Have some Yakumo. You need every bit of nourishment you can get.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.970
Give me some, too.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.300
You don't need any, right?

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:51.060
You're not fighting, just watching. Right?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.640
What is it? You're not hungry?

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:59.110
No. I was thinking of offering it to her highness.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.940
I'm telling you to eat it!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:06.070
The princess should also be tired from all the fighting.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.120
It's no time to be worrying about others!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:12.620
But I have a duty to protect her highness even at the cost of my life.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.540
And you don't have to protect me, your contractee?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.250
What will happen to me if something happens to you?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.630
Thief!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.260
Thief?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.640
Unforgivable!

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:36.600
Calling the one who's been recording the Mototsumitama history through the ages a thief?

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:40.400
No matter how important you are, if you take someone else's things, you're a thief.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.770
Very well...

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.150
Please stop, Namu-san.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.450
Yakumo!

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.210
This is...

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:05.010
If you try to approach the Reiouseki, you'll end up like them.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.630
Where are you hiding? Show yourself!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.340
Kuro!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.850
She fell! She fell!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.600
Behind you!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.560
Keita-san!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:28.900
My exceed, Ryouran Zou, allows me control plants.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:32.950
It means everything around you is your enemy.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:41.670
"If you're going to criticize me for just watching, then shouldn't you do the same to this thing?"

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.850
Yakumo! Are you all right, Yakumo?

00:06:58.680 --> 00:06:59.600
What's this?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:04.270
I corrected his flow of Tera so he can recover faster.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:13.070
I can't move for now, but I feel the Tera inside me flowing rapidly.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.410
I'm sure I'm getting better.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.870
I'm so glad.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:21.370
Then I can take this treat fair and square, right?

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.500
Then...

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.390
Delicious!

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.520
Go!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:53.660
That's some nice Tera. Their synchro's gotten fairly deep, too.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:57.410
It seems those two have really matured.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.080
It'll be a good story to take to Steiner.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:06.290
You sound like one who's about to die.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:12.510
If you don't want to die, defeat Reishin.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.770
I have to hurry to my brother, but now there's this...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.660
It's useless!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.620
Calm down, Kuro. I'll cut you free.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.580
Annoying contractee...

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.380
Kill him first!

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.800
Keita-san!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.140
If we don't find the enemy, we won't stand a chance.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.560
But...

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.640
What's with this dog?

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.650
Keita-san!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.900
Go, Kuro!

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.160
Tenma! Save me!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:27.920
There's no time for that! She's on her way here!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.420
You stupid dog!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:39.590
I'm going to give you a really hard time.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.190
Good boy, Punipuni!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.200
Shit!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.660
Release Keita-san!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.840
The Reiouseki's Tera...

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.480
A fine view, is it not?

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.530
Let's take our time torturing and killing her.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.820
What's this? An earthquake?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.160
The Reiouseki is resonating.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:48.370
Could it be that Reishin-sama arrived already?

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.310
My brother is definitely close to the Reiouseki.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.640
I have to hurry!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.480
Die!
Die!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:33.120
Was this Tera I just felt Kuro's?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.130
Kuro...

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.460
You've already come this close?

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:43.640
It has to be... You're a...

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.560
It's settling down.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.140
This is strange.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.400
What?

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.060
Reishin's Tera...

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.980
He's coming down this way.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.780
Kuro!

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:03.910
Punipuni!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.950
What is it?

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.170
Kuro!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.420
Are you hurt?

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.180
Kuro?

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:26.930
What?

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.520
Where are the Mototsumitama and the other person?

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:31.930
Eh?

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.600
Where'd...

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.440
I'm sorry. It seems they ran away.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.690
Are you all right? You seem a bit off.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.410
I can feel my brother's Tera!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:46.950
What?

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.070
He's close by!

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:49.450
Are you sure, Kuro?

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:02.340
What happened to Kuro back there?

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.840
Besides, that Tera I just felt...

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.070
It's close.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.700
Long time no see...

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:39.960
I'll be taking revenge for Steiner and the Noble One's team.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.290
Steiner?

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:47.010
Please don't. Do you intend to waste the life he died for?

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:50.970
If I can defeat you, I don't care about my life.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.970
That Mototsumitama's life, too?

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:59.270
I knew it... You came to die, right?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:04.820
I'll give you all my Tera in this battle.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.650
Don't even joke about that.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.860
I'll pay you a bonus, so...

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.110
It's not a matter of money.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.500
I'll fight with you until I die.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.870
Ever since I met you...

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.670
Want to perform a contract?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.510
You want to be my contractee?

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.510
There's someone I want to defeat.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:33.760
I knew you were longing for a place to die.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:37.520
You want vengeance?

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.270
Who is it?

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.020
Shishigami Reishin.

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:48.530
And that you aren't the kind of woman who gets along with others easily.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:49.780
What's in it for me?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.780
I'm the same as you...

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:55.290
I also lost my precious partner.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:15:00.210
So I can empathize with you.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.800
Mikami.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.890
You finally called me by my first name.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:18.560
It's been a short time since our contract, but I think I can connect if it's you.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:22.980
If he has no partner, we won't lose.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.190
Mikami, you have my thanks.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.570
Give me your thanks after we've defeated him.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.840
Synchro!
Synchro!

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.600
I won't lie. That's a deep synchro.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:09.230
Hexa Wall.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.290
You're able to manipulate them remotely now?

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:30.630
Celestial Sphere.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:53.280
You dare to refuse a lady's invitation?

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.280
You're a man with no manners!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:08.790
I'm sure you haven't forgotten that your shield can't hold me back.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:15.800
Not yet. You can still take more, Hexa Wall!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.310
It's over.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:42.080
This new Hexa Wall absorbs the energy and is able to return it.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.830
Release!

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.760
That's...

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:16.610
Exceed, Renkabunshin!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.450
Go, Mikami!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:27.500
This is how you fight with a partner.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.790
Now you're really handsome.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.380
This will end it!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:39.970
Steiner, your revenge will be...

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.470
How naïve...

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.270
Did you see something scary?

00:18:55.900 --> 00:19:01.110
If I could understand you, my doubts would likely be cleared as well.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:11.460
And it seems that it's just a matter of time.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.420
Mikami...

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:26.720
Now I'll have to refund you, right?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:32.190
I didn't expect this development.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:35.440
It was my mistake.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.900
Excel...

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.490
Mikami...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:40.440
Why...?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.660
Be careful...

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:44.870
He's...

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:50.200
Reishin is more powerful than before.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.710
He has a contractee.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.630
A contractee?

